                "steps": [
                    {
                        "recipe_order": 13,
                        "step": "Mix components thoroughly and autoclave under a N2-CO2 (4:1, v/v) gas mixture. After cooling, add the following solutions (filter-sterilized): "
                    },
                    {
                        "recipe_order": 17,
                        "step": "Distribute the medium into sterile culture vessels (e.g., 50 ml per 120 ml bottle) under a N2-CO2 (4:1, v/v) gas mixture, and seal with sterile butyl rubber stoppers. Prior to inoculation, add per liter the following solutions (autoclaved or *filter-sterilized and stored under a N2 atmosphere) in the order listed: "
                    }
                ],
